<title>USA: Three Rivers Holdings gets FTC to buy SMT.</title>
<headline>Three Rivers Holdings gets FTC to buy SMT.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Rivers Holding Corp said Thursday it received Federal Trade Commission approval to complete its acquisition of SMT Health Services Inc.</p>
<p>The company said it received notice of early termination of the waiting period.  </p>
<p>On June 24, SMT announced it would be acquired by Three Rivers for $11.75 per share, or $100 million including debt, stock options and warrants.</p>
<p>It said the deal will be structured as a cash tender offer.</p>
<p>Three Rivers is a unit of Apollo Management LP.</p>
